    "written_from": "build.json and m06-evidence.zip in that artifact; the zip is committed byte for byte under pages/evidence/m06-evidence.zip; `uv run python -m src.m06.page record --from <dir>` writes the records in this file and `uv run python -m src.m06.page write` rebuilds pages/sign-off.html from it"
